{"c":[{"id":"349ba64ddd6f940e","sum":"L4 milestone Ref is not a projectbrief pointer: briefs are whole-program. Ticket goes on the checkbox; Done, Risks, and brief are the spec. /niko-preflight dispatches on progress.md Complexity only: L2/L3 default-preflight.md, L4 level4-preflight.md.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260912T175950Z-45ef02d313971bad","text":"L4 milestone Ref is not a projectbrief pointer: briefs are whole-program, not per-slice. Ticket goes on the checkbox when one exists; Done, Risks, and the brief are the spec.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260912T185216Z-0d75b4d2ed056a23","text":"L4 /niko-preflight dispatches on progress.md Complexity only (never milestones.md presence): L2/L3 default-preflight.md, L4 level4-preflight.md; spawn line unchanged; live paths need chore(dev): ai-rizz sync after PR #125 merges","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"ac31e82c9ee47581","sum":"speedup-giesen: a-la-carte skill at rules/speedup-giesen/SKILL.md (no ruleset), keyed on Giesen 2020 2x/100x tweet; audit-then-wait: report stupid-class findings, operator picks cuts, no edits in the report turn.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260913T231422Z-b6356c0b0c7eb90a","text":"speedup-giesen is an a-la-carte skill at rules/speedup-giesen/SKILL.md; opening key is Giesen 2020 2x/100x tweet; no ruleset.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260913T232538Z-077e296baa4ce7f2","text":"speedup-giesen is audit-then-wait: report stupid-class findings; operator picks which to cut; do not edit in the report turn.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
